  A["terminal response (LSAPI · proxy · static)"] --> B("app opted in?<br/>X-LiteSpeed-Cache-Control: public|private,max-age=N<br/>(or standard Cache-Control on a --page-cache-standard-vhosts vhost)")
  B -- no --> N["not stored"]:::bad
  B -- yes --> C("guards")
  C -- "status not in cacheStatusCode · Set-Cookie of a private cookie<br/>· proxied response asserting X-LiteSpeed-* · self-redirect Location<br/>· purge received after render start · object > 100 MiB" --> N
  C -- ok --> D("W-TinyLFU admission<br/>frequency ≥ --page-cache-admit-threshold (+1 per 256 KiB)")
  D -- "not yet" --> N2["counted, not stored (miss-miss-hit)"]:::bad
  D -- admitted --> E["strip Set-Cookie + X-LiteSpeed-* from the public copy<br/>record identity (host + raw path), tags, vary set, TTL, stale windows"]
  E --> F("file tier on?")
  F -- no --> G["in-RAM body (charged to --page-cache-mem)"]:::ok
  F -- yes --> H["HJPC file at birth (identity form, tmpfs)<br/>metadata-only charge to RAM index; footprint to --page-cache-disk-mem"]:::ok
  H -- "at store time (bounded background pool)" --> I["background dict recompress in place<br/>(per-vhost zstd dictionary, 3.5–9× smaller)"]:::ok
